    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing. rebuild what? i don't have anything left in me to rebuild with. i put every single ounce of my soul, my time, my energy into that. it's like i've already spent my whole life, and i'm just... empty. starting over sounds like a joke when you're already running on zero. it feels like there's just no point in staying in the game when you've already lost everything.",
